  "rules_text": {
    "raw": "The illumination level in the area drops to darkness regardless of the existing lighting conditions. Non-mythic spells and effects can’t increase the light level in the area. Creatures with darkvision and the power to see in darkness have difficulty seeing through this darkness, and can see as well as a human can in dim light. Creatures in the area of darkness take a –2 penalty on saves against fear.",
    "search_text": "Mythic Darkness lowers the illumination level to darkness, prevents non-mythic effects from increasing it, impedes darkvision and seeing in darkness, and imposes a –2 penalty on saves against fear.",
